  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Hex Spell. For 20 seconds, this hex does nothing. When Rising Bile ends, that foe and all foes in the area take 1...5...6 damage for each second Rising Bile was in effect.",
      "zhTW": "持續 20 秒，此「降咒」對目標並沒有直接的效果。當憤怒高漲結束時，該目標及範圍內的所有敵人依照此「降咒」在他們身上的停留時間，每秒給予他們 1～6 傷害。"
    },
